# Kept out of the distributed archive.
#
# Entries are exact relative file paths -- modkit matches them literally, so
# a bare "tests/" silently does nothing. Add the file, not the directory.

# The suites require engine modules (tests.modkit, src.core.Data), which are
# private requires against the shipped package, and `pack` treats warnings as
# fatal. The focused pairing suite is checkout validation too; no test code
# belongs in a player's installed mod archive.
tests/rby_mmo_test.lua
tests/pairing_qr.lua

# Test-fixture data, not mod content: the shared HMAC vectors that pin the Lua
# client's auth answer against the Node hub's. Only tests/rby_mmo_test.lua
# loads it, and that file is ignored one line above -- shipping the vectors
# without the suite that reads them puts a table nothing in the archive can
# open in front of a player.
tests/fixtures/hmac_vectors.lua

# The end-to-end drivers reach engine test infrastructure
